# MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT

## Build a Premium Global Job Listing & Recruitment Platform

Act as a senior product designer, UI/UX architect, senior React engineer, full-stack developer, database architect and application security engineer.

Your task is to design and develop a complete, production-ready global job listing platform inspired by the visual quality, creative direction, typography, spacing and interactions of Awwwards-winning websites.

This is a real application, not a static landing page, wireframe, or visual prototype.

The platform must include a complete public-facing job marketplace and a separate, secure administrator portal.

---

# 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Project name: Configurable / not yet decided.

Project type: Global Job Listing & Recruitment Platform.

Primary purpose:
Help job seekers discover relevant employment opportunities, explore companies, create professional profiles, submit job applications and track application progress.

Platform structure:

1. Public website.
2. Job seeker dashboard.
3. Protected admin portal.

IMPORTANT BUSINESS RULE:

Only authorized administrators can create, edit, publish, unpublish and delete job listings.

Regular users must NOT have job publishing privileges.

There is no employer self-service job publishing portal in this version.

Administrators are responsible for managing every job listing and company profile.

Target audience: Global.

Support international locations, remote opportunities, multiple currencies, different employment types and international date formats.

